NPC-38 Recloser Control: DNP3 Device Profile
Document NPC38-DP-0407 Rev 3, 11/2024. Applies to NPC-38 firmware R4.07. DNP3 subset level 2; serial
(RS-485) and TCP/IP. Factory default point map below.
Binary inputs (object 1, variation 2; events object 2)
Index Name
0 Recloser closed (52a)
1 79 reclose blocked
2 Control lockout
3 Hot line tag
4 Ground trip blocked
5 Remote control enabled
6 Battery alarm
7 Cabinet door open
Analog inputs (object 30, variation 1; events object 32)
Index Name Units
0 Voltage A, source side V
1 Voltage B, source side V
2 Voltage C, source side V
3 Real power, three-phase kW
4 Reactive power, three-phase kVAr
5 Current A A
6 Current B A
7 Current C A
8 Frequency Hz
9 Voltage A, load side V
10 Voltage B, load side V
11 Voltage C, load side V
12 Energy delivered kWh
13 Energy received kWh
Control relay output blocks (object 12)
Index Name
0 Trip
1 Close
Power and energy signs follow the control's metering direction setting.
